sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as trainer-operator<br/>controller-manager
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>(manifest templates)
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(via ServiceMonitor)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Trainer CR Reconciliation
        User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Trainer CR<br/>(default-trainer)
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Check dependencies<br/>(JobSet Operator health, CRDs)<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Dependency status
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Ensure namespace exists<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Namespace ready
        Controller->>FS: Copy templates to writable dir<br/>Apply RELATED_IMAGE overrides
        FS-->>Controller: Templates ready
        Controller->>FS: Kustomize render<br/>(trainer core + runtimes + imagestreams)
        FS-->>Controller: Rendered manifests
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply (SSA)<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Resources applied
        Controller->>K8sAPI: GC cleanup (label-based)<br/>Remove stale resources<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Cleanup complete
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer CR status<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Status updated
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Prom,Controller: Flow 2: Metrics Scraping
        Prom->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (cluster profile, service-ca cert)<br/>Auth: Bearer token (ServiceAccount)
        Controller-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics<br/>(controller-runtime)
    end
